---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: caller invokes releaseVestedTokens(investor)
    q_check_vesting --> q_error_no_vesting: position.vestingContract == address(0)
    q_error_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_vesting --> q_calc_release: position.vestingContract != address(0)
    q_calc_release --> q_check_amount: releasable = vestingContract.releasableAmount()
    q_check_amount --> q_error_nothing: releasable == 0
    q_error_nothing --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_check_amount --> q_release: releasable > 0
    q_release --> q_emit: vestingContract.release() transfers releasable askTokens to investor
    q_emit --> [*]: emit VestedTokensReleased(investor, releasable)

    note right of q_calc_release
        INV-001: Vested tokens release according to predefined schedule
        INV-002: Only tokens that have vested up to block.timestamp are releasable
        INV-003: Cumulative released tokens <= vestingAmount for each investor
    end note
